            "h": 1,
            "id": "intro",
            "kind": "text",
            "label": "",
            "mode": "caption",
            "tone": "plain",
            "value": "Five AI reviewers read the manuscript in parallel, each with its own remit; a judge merges what they found. The AI advises — you decide.",
